      "text": "# nuScenes sample\n\nA short drive through Singapore, adapted from the nuScenes dataset.\n\n- **Tabs hold whole layouts.** Every tab here is split into several panels. Drop a panel on the middle of another to make tabs, or on a panel's edge inside a tab to split that tab.\n- **Rename a tab** with a double-click.\n- **Drag panels** by the grip at the left of their toolbar.\n- Hover a message path in any panel to see where it comes from; open a panel's settings with the gear."
